  {
   "n": 13,
   "type": "MCQ",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "single | Marks +1 / -0.33",
   "html": "<p>For a flip-flop with provisions for preset and clear.</p>",
   "options": [
    {
     "key": "A",
     "html": "<p>Preset and clear operations are performed simultaneously</p>"
    },
    {
     "key": "B",
     "html": "<p>While presetting, clear is disabled.</p>"
    },
    {
     "key": "C",
     "html": "<p>While clearing, preset is disabled.</p>"
    },
    {
     "key": "D",
     "html": "<p>Both (b) and (c) are true.</p>"
    }
   ],
   "answer": [
    "D"
   ],
   "natRange": null,
   "answerText": "D",
   "marks": {
    "pos": 1,
    "neg": 0.33
   },
   "solution": "<p>The preset input drives the flip-flop to a set state while the clear input drives it to a reset state.<br>Hence, both are disabled or only one is enabled at a time.</p>"
  },
