   "type": "MCQ",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "single | Marks +1 / -0.33",
   "html": "<p>The table which shows the necessary levels at <em>J </em>and <em>K </em>inputs to produce every possible flip-flop&nbsp;state transition is called</p>",
